  "title": "Old-Fashioned Chicken And Slick Dumplings",
  "description": "The rich savor of chicken fat infuses flour dumplings that are cooked in a delightful soup of chicken, carrots, onions, sweet potatoes and Irish potatoes.",
  "authors": [
